WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:07.166
Morning, after the scan: your Home.
New roles at all your companies.

2
00:00:08.323 --> 00:00:14.823
Companies by ring: clients,
lapsed clients and target companies.

3
00:00:15.354 --> 00:00:21.854
Open for 45+ days: they probably
won’t fill it on their own.

4
00:00:29.132 --> 00:00:35.632
Role detail: the posting, the history
and a reason to call right now.

5
00:00:37.188 --> 00:00:43.435
Your saved contacts at the company
always come first.

6
00:00:43.685 --> 00:00:50.185
Whom to call: we guess who decides,
and where to find them.

7
00:00:53.826 --> 00:01:00.326
A draft you can edit.
You send it yourself and log it.

8
00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:15.152
Got a candidate? Who wants them?
Paste a CV or a few lines.

9
00:01:15.402 --> 00:01:21.131
Name and contact details go before AI.
The profile isn’t stored.

10
00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:27.881
Roles at your companies, best match first:
what fits, what doesn’t, whom to call.

11
00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:37.763
No ATS? Candidates and a pipeline
come with TalentRadar.

12
00:01:41.413 --> 00:01:47.656
Try it on your own companies:
send your list at talentradar.eu.
